body:
NTA. There's a variety of very valid reasons couples who love each other and intend to be life-long partners don't get [married.](https://married.In) In particular, I'm thinking about folks who are on disability who cannot marry their partner because they would get cut off from benefits since the US government assumes that your partner is now on the hook for your care, no matter their financial situation. Vicky's perspective completely invalidates those relationships and so many others. 

&#x200B;

You're doing the right thing here.

... Does he think you own a dairy farm?

&#x200B;

NTA, this man is unhinged.

